# ABOUTME: Species of the JAFF-generated network for Microphysics (network_properties.H):
# ABOUTME: one line per species: name, short name (a C++ identifier), A, Z
#
# name = the species as in the network; short name = its j/k form (+ -> j, - -> k),
# which Microphysics turns into an enum (C becomes Carbon: C is Microphysics'
# constants namespace); A = mass in atomic mass units; Z = charge.
# A and Z only label the species here: the EOS (eos/) uses the masses in grams.
$$JAFF LANG cxx
$$JAFF COMMENT "#"
$$JAFF CALL species_table
